        "quiz_type": "single_choice",
        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "Let \\(\\vec{a}\\) and \\(\\vec{b}\\) be nonzero vectors. If \\(\\left|\\vec{a}+\\vec{b}\\right|=\\left|\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}\\right|\\), the angle between them is",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "Squaring the equality gives \\(\\left|\\vec{a}\\right|^2+\\left|\\vec{b}\\right|^2+2\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}=\\left|\\vec{a}\\right|^2+\\left|\\vec{b}\\right|^2-2\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}\\). Hence \\(\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}=0\\), so the vectors are perpendicular.",
        "question_audio": null,
        "time_limit_seconds": 30,
        "points": 10,
        "sort_order": 96,
