        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "For nonzero vectors \\(\\vec{a}\\) and \\(\\vec{b}\\), if \\(\\left|\\vec{a}+\\vec{b}\\right|<\\left|\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}\\right|\\), then the angle between \\(\\vec{a}\\) and \\(\\vec{b}\\) is",
