        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "If \\(\\left|\\vec{a}\\right|=3\\), \\(\\left|\\vec{b}\\right|=4\\), and the angle between them is \\(60^{\\circ}\\), then \\(\\left|2\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}\\right|\\) equals",
