        "explanation": "\\(\\left|2\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}\\right|^2=4\\left|\\vec{a}\\right|^2+\\left|\\vec{b}\\right|^2-4\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}\\). Since \\(\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}=3\\cdot4\\cos 60^{\\circ}=6\\), the squared magnitude is \\(36+16-24=28\\). Therefore, \\(\\left|2\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}\\right|=2\\sqrt{7}\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
