        "quiz_type": "single_choice",
        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "Three nonzero vectors satisfy \\(\\vec{a}+\\vec{b}+\\vec{c}=\\vec{0}\\) and \\(\\left|\\vec{a}\\right|=\\left|\\vec{b}\\right|=\\left|\\vec{c}\\right|\\). The angle between \\(\\vec{a}\\) and \\(\\vec{b}\\) is",
